  "Configures how the agent tries to access files outside of its working folders.": "配置智能体尝试访问其工作文件夹之外的文件时的行为。",
  "Controls whether terminal commands require your approval before running.": "控制终端命令在运行前是否需要您的批准。",
  "Disable pre-warming of workspace clones.": "禁用工作区克隆的预热功能。",
